{"title":"Get In Touch","markdown":{"yaml":{"page-layout":"full","format":{"html":{"toc":false}}},"headingText":"Get In Touch","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n:::{.contact-content}\nWe welcome inquiries from **Caltech students, postdocs, and faculty** who are interested in biological data analysis or need assistance setting up a data analysis workflow.\n:::\n\n:::{.contact-info}\n**Location:** BCK 340 <br>\n**Email:** <a href=\"mailto:bioinformatics@caltech.edu\">bioinformatics@caltech.edu</a>\n:::\n\n:::{.contact-dark}\nBefore starting your experiment, we request that you meet with us to go over your experiment goals. This helps ensure you get the most out of your data.\n\nIf you’re seeking help with a project, please include:\n\n* A short description of your research question  \n* The type of data (e.g., scRNA-seq, bulk RNA-seq, spatial transcriptomics)  \n* What stage your project is in and what you’d like help with\n\nWe recommend that you view our [**tutorial page**](https://pachterlab.github.io/cbrc-spec/) before contacting us.\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n:::{.contact-content}\n# Get In Touch\nWe welcome inquiries from **Caltech students, postdocs, and faculty** who are interested in biological data analysis or need assistance setting up a data analysis workflow.\n:::\n\n:::{.contact-info}\n**Location:** BCK 340 <br>\n**Email:** <a href=\"mailto:bioinformatics@caltech.edu\">bioinformatics@caltech.edu</a>\n:::\n\n:::{.contact-dark}\nBefore starting your experiment, we request that you meet with us to go over your experiment goals. This helps ensure you get the most out of your data.\n\nIf you’re seeking help with a project, please include:\n\n* A short description of your research question  \n* The type of data (e.g., scRNA-seq, bulk RNA-seq, spatial transcriptomics)  \n* What stage your project is in and what you’d like help with\n\nWe recommend that you view our [**tutorial page**](https://pachterlab.github.io/cbrc-spec/) before contacting us.\n:::\